":["Makes [RCV] orbs beneficial for Driven and Powerhouse characters. Makes [TND] orbs beneficial for Driven and Powerhouse characters. Makes [RCV] and [TND] orbs beneficial for Driven and Powerhouse characters"],"sailorNotes":null,"limitBreak":[],"potentialAbilities":[],"supportData":[],"swapData":{"base":"Reduces Paralysis duration completely on this character, changes the orb of this character into a Matching orb and sets Chain Boundaries to 1.6x and 35.0x for 1 turn.","super":"Reduces Paralysis duration completely on this character, changes the orb of this character into a Matching orb and sets Chain Boundaries to 2.5x and 35.0x for 2 turns.","superTurns":6},"vsSpecial":null,"superType":null,"superClass":null,"rumbleData":{"basedOn":3433,"id":3432}}');
    

