art of the fight, boosts ATK of [STR] and [INT] characters by 5x, boosts HP of [STR] and [INT] characters by 1.3x, boosts chances of getting Matching orbs on [STR] and [INT] characters and makes [STR] and [INT] orbs beneficial for [STR] and [INT] characters. Deals 0x-800x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to one enemy at the end of each turn depending on how many PERFECTs scored that turn."}],"captainNotes":"End of turn damage is based on how many PERFECTs you hit this turn: 0 PERFECTs - 0x ATK; 1 PERFECT - 100x ATK; 2 PERFECTs - 200x ATK; 3 PERFECTs - 300x ATK; 4 PERFECTs - 400x ATK; 5 PERFECTs - 500x ATK; 6 PERFECTs - 600x ATK. [LLB] End of turn damage is based on how many PERFECTs you hit this turn: 0 PERFECTs - 0x ATK; 1 PERFECT - 150x ATK; 2 PERFECTs - 250x ATK; 3 PERFECTs - 350x ATK; 4 PERFECTs - 500x ATK; 5 PERFECTs - 650x ATK; 6 PERFECTs - 800x ATK. #{beneficial}","specialName":"Roiling Hound Blaze","specialText":"Deals 200x character''s ATK in Typeless True damage to one enemy, reduces enemies'' Increased Defense and Percent Damage Reduction duration by 2 turns, changes all orbs, including [BLOCK] orbs, into Matching orbs and boosts Orb Effects of [STR] and [INT] characters by 2.25x for 1 turn. If you have used 20 or more [STR] or [INT] orbs in attacks when the special is activated, reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 12 turns.. Deals 200x character''s ATK in Typeless True damage to one enemy, reduces enemies'' Increased Defense and Percent Damage Reduction duration by 3 turns, changes all orbs, including [BLOCK] orbs, into Matching orbs and boosts Orb Effects of [STR] and [INT] characters by 2.25x for 1 turn. If you have used 16 or more [STR] or [INT] orbs in attacks when the special is activated, reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 12 turns. If your crew has Orb Amplification when the special is activated, boosts ATK of [STR] and [INT] characters by 2.25x for 1 turn.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaT