 all enemies by 1 turn; delays all enemies by 1 turn otherwise.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaText":null,"superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":null,"partyConflictKeys":["usopp & yasopp","usopp","yasopp"],"builderAbilities":[],"sailorAbilities":["Removes Blindness duration completely"],"sailorNotes":null,"limitBreak":[],"potentialAbilities":[],"supportData":[],"swapData":{"base":"Changes the orb of this character into a Matching orb, reduces enemies'' Shooter and Free Spirit Resistance by -15% for 1 turn and removes Despair and Paralysis duration completely on this character.","super":"Changes orbs of this and adjacent characters into Matching orbs, reduces enemies'' Shooter and Free Spirit Resistance by -30% for 1 turn and removes Despair and Paralysis duration completely on this character.","superTurns":6},"vsSpecial":null,"superType":null,"superClass":null,"rumbleData":{"basedOn":3708,"id":3707}}');
    

