 enemy turn. If there is a [STR], [DEX], [QCK], [PSY] and [INT] character in your crew, when an enemy inflicts you with Paralysis, reduce Paralysis duration by half and reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 1-99 turns, depending on how many turns of Paralysis reduced."},{"key":"llbcharacter1","label":"LLB Captain Ability (Character 1)","text":"Reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 2 turns at the start of the fight, reduces Special Cooldown of all characters by 1 turn at the start of the fight, increases damage received by 1.75x, boosts ATK of all characters by 4.5x, boosts HP of all characters by 2x and recovers HP proportional to the number of enemies you defeated in that turn ✕ crew''s RCV at the end of the enemy turn. If there is a [STR], [DEX], [QCK], [PSY] and [INT] character in your crew, when an enemy inflicts you with Paralysis, reduce Paralysis duration by half and reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 1-99 turns, depending on how many turns of Paralysis reduced."},{"key":"llbcharacter2","label":"LLB Captain Ability (Character 2)","text":"Reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 2 turns at the start of the fight, reduces Special Cooldown of all characters by 1 turn at the start of the fight, increases damage received by 1.75x, boosts ATK of all characters by 4.5x, boosts HP of all characters by 2x and recovers HP proportional to the number of enemies you defeated in that turn ✕ crew''s RCV at the end of the enemy turn. If there is a [STR], [DEX], [QCK], [PSY] and [INT] character in your crew, when an enemy inflicts you with Paralysis, reduce Paralysis duration by half and reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 1-99 turns, depending on how many turns of Paralysis reduced."},{"key":"llbcombined","label":"LLB Captain Ability (Combined)","text":"Reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 2 turns at the start of the fight, reduces Special Cooldown of all characters by 1 turn at the start of the fight, increases damage recei