re","specialText":"Deals 10% of enemies'' current HP in damage to all enemies. Boosts ATK of Driven and Cerebral characters by 2.5x-3x for 1 turn based on the number of status effects applied on enemy. If enemies have 8 or more status effects when the special is activated, increases boost effects of ATK UP buffs by +0.25x, including effects activated in the same Ability. Reduces Bind and Burn duration by 6 turns, boosts ATK against enemies inflicted with Increase Damage Taken or Negative by 2.5x for 1 turn, paralyzes (75%) all enemies for 2 turns, and becomes Moria & Perona for 2 turns.","specialNotes":"2.5x for for 0-2 effects, 2.75x for 3-5 effects, 3x for 6+ effects","superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaText":null,"superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":null,"partyConflictKeys":["moria & perona","moria","perona"],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"remove_bind","label":"Remove Bind","minTurns":6,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"remove_burn","label":"Remove Burn","minTurns":6,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"}],"sailorAbilities":["Makes [RCV] and [TND] orbs beneficial for Driven and Cerebral characters"],"sailorNotes":null,"limitBreak":[],"potentialAbilities":[],"supportData":[],"swapData":{"base":"Inflicts enemies with Negative for 1 turn, reduces enemies'' Driven and Cerebral Resistance by -15% for 1 turn, and recovers 2,000 HP at end of each turn for 1 turn.","super":"Ignores debuff protection and inflicts enemies with Negative for 1 turn, reduces enemies'' Driven and Cerebral Resistance by -25% for 1 turn, and recovers 8,000 HP at end of each turn for 1 turn.","superTurns":6},"vsSpecial":null,"superType":null,"superClass":null,"rumbleData":{"basedOn":4124,"id":4123}}');
    

